ned + 1 presence-only).\\n5. Fresh-checkout probe set matches the declared set.\\n6. Critique artifact exists and is tracked.\\n7. Bump rationale rendered verbatim.\\n8. Quality numbers internally consistent (exit 0 in 163.0s vs 163.021s);\\n   pending states honestly bounded; no overclaim.\\n\\n## Minor observations (not failures)\\n\\n- Probe-pass status rests on the helper's own probe runs (advisory).\\n- Bare `current_release.py` re-run reports probes `not_established`\\n  (expected; probes run under the helper, not the listing).\\n\\n## Out of scope (not counted against)\\n\\nCode correctness — owned by the critique artifact and the standing suite.\\n\\n## Disposition\\n\\nNo unsupported numbers, figures, or verification sentences found.\\nProceed to resume publication.\\n\",\n    \"prompt_encoding\": \"utf-8\",\n    \"size_bytes\": 1880,\n    \"source\": \"23dc82206dd5f18fdc4524f55ad48286b63f5820:charness-artifacts/release-review/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-claims.md\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"carrier_path\": \".charness/scratch/critique-review/review-7d0dd92638ee3051a2a07bbbaaf0d41e/semantic-input/0002-content.bin\",\n    \"carrier_sha256\": \"c1cc5b87698e0d745f8387b0b3a067dd363e800dfb57986cf3eefee1ecccd343\",\n    \"content_sha256\": \"c1cc5b87698e0d745f8387b0b3a067dd363e800dfb57986cf3eefee1ecccd343\",\n    \"disposition\": \"present\",\n    \"path\": \"charness-artifacts/release-review/2026-09-15-v8.7.1-prepared-claims-review.json\",\n    \"prompt_content\": \"{\\n  \\\"schema_version\\\": \\\"charness.release.claims-review.v4\\\",\\n  \\\"prepared_commit\\\": \\\"34e767973e60fff9fcadf054e165085356e44f6b\\\",\\n  \\\"release_record_path\\\": \\\"charness-artifacts/release/latest.md\\\",\\n  \\\"release_record_sha256\\\": \\\"0c58955c1636988097921990fdb0dae93b1bbffdf368843622914c1ef5f8dbef\\\",\\n  \\\"target_version\\\": \\\"8.7.1\\\",\\n  \\\"tag_name\\\": \\\"v8.7.1\\\",\\n  \\\"verdict\\\": \\\"pass\\\",\\n  \\\"preparer_context\\\": \\\"release helper fresh prepare for 