4 the same page returns 200 for a pushed tag with no release, and the tag is pushed before the release is created\\\",\\n    \\\"establishes\\\": \\\"public-page-reachable-and-names-the-tag\\\",\\n    \\\"evidence_len\\\": 202376,\\n    \\\"expected_content\\\": \\\"v8.7.1\\\",\\n    \\\"fetched_url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/corca-ai/charness/releases/tag/v8.7.1\\\",\\n    \\\"http_status\\\": 200,\\n    \\\"observer\\\": \\\"unauthenticated-http (credential-free; same host/process as publisher)\\\",\\n    \\\"status\\\": \\\"confirmed\\\",\\n    \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://github.com/corca-ai/charness/releases/tag/v8.7.1\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"installed_readback\\\": {\\n    \\\"doctor\\\": {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"charness doctor\\\",\\n      \\\"returncode\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"confirmed\\\",\\n      \\\"value\\\": \\\"source: codex_host_guidance\\\"\\n    },\\n    \\\"install_refresh\\\": {\\n      \\\"command\\\": \\\"charness update\\\",\\n      \\\"elapsed_seconds\\\": 7.989,\\n      \\\"returncode\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"refreshed\\\",\\n      \\\"stderr_tail\\\": \\\"STEP: refreshing source checkout\\\\nSTEP: refreshing install surface\\\\nSTEP: refreshing Codex host cache\\\\nDONE: update complete\\\",\\n      \\\"stdout_tail\\\": \\\"de to load or\\\\n    refresh charness.\\\\ngrok_host_guidance:\\\\n  status: installed\\\\n  manual_action_required: false\\\\n  message: Grok plugin tree is present at `~/.grok/plugins/charness`. List `charness`\\\\n    in `[plugins].enabled` (do not add a marketplace), then restart Grok Build.\\\\nhost_next_steps:\\\\n  codex: Codex host install markers are present. Start a new Codex session to load\\\\n    charness.\\\\n  claude: Claude host install markers are present. Restart Claude Code to load or\\\\n    refresh charness.\\\\n  grok: Grok plugin tree is present at `~/.grok/plugins/charness`. List `charness`\\\\n    in `[plugins].enabled` (do not add a marketplace), then restart Grok Build.\\