    "prompt_content": "# v8.7.2 claims review (parent narrative)\n\nDate: 2026-09-15. Reviewer: parent agent (prepared the release lane).\nObserver: distinct workflow child agent, verdict PASS, no findings.\n\nThis narrative binds the prepared commit `53e61b8344b2b0b8ac83db5959fa864a8e1f5813` only.\n\n## What was audited\n\nThe prepared record `charness-artifacts/release/latest.md` at `53e61b83` —\nits assertions only, not code correctness (covered by the release critique\nworker `review-20260915T130702Z-3593657` and the standing suite).\n\n## Observer findings (all hold)\n\n1. Record claims target 8.7.2 / tag v8.7.2, previous 8.7.1 (latest.md:7,11-12).\n2. Prepared commit diff bumps packaging/charness.json 8.7.1→8.7.2\n   (3 version fields) and .claude-plugin/marketplace.json 8.7.1→8.7.2 —\n   bump matches the claimed target.\n3. Working-tree corroboration: packaging/charness.json lines 5,26,69 all\n   8.7.2; marketplace lines 8,14 both 8.7.2; materialized\n   plugins/charness/.claude-plugin/plugin.json line 3 is 8.7.2 — matches\n   the record's no-drift end state (latest.md:19).\n4. Quality line claims exit 0 AND discloses \"quality unestablished:\n   pytest-release pending final resume\" at post-bump, pre-commit —\n   no bound-receipt overclaim; runtime (quality_command 86.991s) is\n   consistent with the claimed 87.0s.\n5. Fresh-checkout probes claimed passed with the 3 declared commands\n   (latest.md:68-73); runtime corroborates a probe step ran (5.491s);\n   no public-surface pass claimed (push/release/publication all pending).\n6. Bump rationale present verbatim (latest.md:85-87): patch not minor,\n   #815 implementation-lane repair, no registered public surface moved —\n   matches the critique record's release line.\n7. Critique artifact binds Release 8.7.2; packet verify exits current\n   with sha ece07cdc… matching the artifact's recorded identities.\n8. State marker `prepared-awaiting-claims-review`; the record stages\n   itself for this review rather than claiming the critique findings\n   satisfied.\n\n## Minor observations (not failures)\n\n- Probe-pass and quality-exit-0 rest on the helper's own runs; the\n  observer did not re-execute them, and the record discloses the\n  residual (pytest-release pending final resume).\n- Single prepare line: no recovery/reset history unlike 8.7.1.\n\n## Out of scope (not counted against)\n\nCode correctness — owned by the critique artifact and the standing suite.\n\n## Disposition\n\nNo unsupported numbers, figures, or verification sentences found.\nProceed to resume publication.\n",
